  ("ing authors in technology and business." 0.2937 0.6269 0.6166 0.6380 0.6380 0.0214 0.0053 0.2640 0.0267)
  ("Technology professionals, software developers, web designers, and business and crea‐" 0.1429 0.8571 0.6447 0.6661 0.6661 0.0214 0.0051 0.2732 0.0973)
  ("tive professionals use Safari Books Online as their primary resource for research, prob‐" 0.1429 0.8571 0.6637 0.6851 0.6851 0.0214 0.0039 0.3290 0.0304)
  ("lem solving, learning, and certification training." 0.1428 0.5401 0.6828 0.7042 0.7042 0.0214 0.0047 0.3362 0.0312)
  ("Safari Books Online offers a range of product mixes and pricing programs for organi‐" 0.1428 0.8571 0.7109 0.7323 0.7323 0.0214 0.0049 0.3230 0.0476)
  ("zations, government agencies, and individuals. Subscribers have access to thousands of" 0.1429 0.8571 0.7299 0.7513 0.7513 0.0214 0.0040 0.3089 0.0639)
